  {
   "t": 0.0,
   "support": "If you're trying to *lose weight*…"
  },
  {
   "t": 1.62,
   "support": "you don't need the gym, a diet, anything."
  },
  {
   "t": 3.68,
   "support": "Just *one injection* a week is enough."
  },
  {
   "t": 5.4,
   "support": "And that injection costs just ₹1,300.",
   "until": 7.4
  },
  {
   "t": 11.67,
   "support": "Before you book a doctor's appointment,"
  },
  {
   "t": 13.14,
   "support": "watch this video till the end.",
   "hero": "WATCH THIS",
   "hero_t": 13.32,
   "fx": "pop"
  },
  {
   "t": 14.52,
   "support": "Celebrities, social media —"
  },
  {
   "t": 16.06,
   "support": "why is there so much *hype*?"
  },
  {
   "t": 17.42,
   "support": "What's in it? So I",
   "hero": "RESEARCHED IT",
   "hero_t": 18.36,
   "fx": "underline",
   "until": 19.18,
   "hero_first": false
  },
  {
   "t": 19.2,
   "support": "From this March, the *Ozempic* molecule"
  },
  {
   "t": 20.84,
   "support": "has gone *off patent*."
  },
  {
   "t": 21.78,
   "support": "In India, a drug now starts at ₹1,300."
  },
  {
   "t": 24.9,
   "support": "Does it work, bro?"
  },
  {
   "t": 26.1,
   "support": "Yes.",
   "hero": "IT WORKS",
   "hero_t": 26.16,
   "fx": "plate",
   "until": 26.93,
   "hero_first": false
  },
  {
   "t": 26.95,
   "support": "In the STEP 1 trial, participants"
  },
  {
   "t": 28.67,
   "support": "lost *15%* of their body weight."
  },
  {
   "t": 31.13,
   "support": "So should we shut down the gym?",
   "hero": "SHUT THE GYM?",
   "hero_t": 31.61,
   "fx": "plate",
   "until": 32.7
  },
  {
   "t": 34.34,
   "support": "The ads won't tell you"
  },
  {
   "t": 35.01,
   "support": "these *3 things* you need to know.",
   "until": 36.95
  },
  {
   "t": 37.0,
   "support": "And the last one",
   "hero": "CHANGES THE|WHOLE TRIAL",
   "hero_t": 38.96,
   "fx": "mask",
   "hero_first": false
  },
  {
   "t": 40.78,
   "support": "One: it's a",
   "hero": "PRESCRIPTION DRUG",
   "hero_t": 41.24,
   "fx": "plate",
   "hero_first": false
  },
  {
   "t": 41.98,
   "support": "India's Health Ministry says"
  },
  {
   "t": 43.52,
   "support": "don't take it without a doctor's prescription.",
   "until": 46.0
  },
  {
   "t": 46.06,
   "support": "Two: *nausea* and *diarrhoea*"
  },
  {
   "t": 47.78,
   "support": "are common side effects of this drug.",
   "until": 49.35,
   "hero": "SIDE EFFECTS",
   "hero_t": 48.46,
   "fx": "underline",
   "hero_first": false
  },
  {
   "t": 49.4,
   "support": "Three: people in this trial also made"
  },
  {
   "t": 51.12,
   "support": "*activity changes* and *diet changes*.",
   "until": 53.9
  },
  {
   "t": 53.96,
   "support": "The scale will show your weight dropping,"
  },
  {
   "t": 55.58,
   "support": "but nobody asks how much *muscle* you kept.",
   "until": 57.75
  },
  {
   "t": 57.8,
   "support": "That's where",
   "hero": "RESISTANCE|TRAINING",
   "hero_t": 58.24,
   "fx": "plate",
   "hero_first": false,
   "until": 59.66
  },
  {
   "t": 59.68,
   "support": "and *diet* become very important."
  },
  {
   "t": 60.52,
   "support": "If you're curious about it,"
  },
  {
   "t": 61.78,
   "support": "talk to a good",
   "hero": "DOCTOR",
   "hero_t": 62.16,
   "fx": "plate",
   "hero_first": false
  },
  {
   "t": 63.12,
   "support": "Don't try it just because"
  },
  {
   "t": 63.92,
   "support": "you saw the ads and the *hype*.",
   "until": 65.95
  },
  {
   "t": 65.99,
   "support": "What really gives you healthy, *sustained results*"
  },
  {
